caption: Animals
tradition-component: animals

The Animal Word list is fixed. Every Animal Word is an IQ/Very Hard skill with a base energy cost of 2.

Ferret: Forthright, tenacious, systematic, meticulous, charismatic, sensitive, hardworking, industrious, charming, eloquent, sociable, artistic, shrewd. Can be manipulative, vindictive, mendacious, venal, selfish, obstinate, critical, over-ambitious, ruthless, intolerant, scheming. Base casting time of 1.

Good At: Investigation, persistence, trickery, rooting out hidden things

Bad At: Noble or “high” works (honor, grandeur, divine law)

Exclusive: Ferret is the only animal that can have a subtle display; Ferret magic is not always extremely obvious.

Forbidden: Cannot inspire awe or majesty; no positive morale effects

Ox: Dependable, calm, methodical, born leader, patient, hardworking, ambitious, conventional, steady, modest, logical, resolute, tenacious. Can be stubborn, narrow-minded, materialistic, rigid, demanding. Base casting time of 3

Good At: Endurance, strength, stability, protection, slow but unstoppable force

Bad At: Deception, trickery, sudden change

Forbidden: Cannot create illusions or shapeshift

Tiger: Unpredictable, rebellious, colorful, powerful, passionate, daring, impulsive, vigorous, stimulating, sincere, affectionate, humanitarian, generous. Can be restless, reckless, impatient, quick-tempered, obstinate, selfish, aggressive. Base casting time of 2

Good At: Bold offense, intimidation, inspiring courage, sudden decisive action, rebellion.

Bad At: Patient, constructive work (crafting, sustained healing, long rituals).

Forbidden: Cannot create lasting structures or works of craftsmanship (Tiger destroys, it does not build)

Rabbit/Cat: Luckiest of all, Gracious, good friend, kind, sensitive, soft-spoken, amiable, elegant, reserved, cautious, artistic, thorough, tender, self-assured, shy, astute, compassionate, flexible. Can be moody, detached, superficial, self-indulgent, opportunistic, stubborn. Base casting time of 1.

Good At: Luck, agility, stealth, friendship, graceful combat

Bad At: Direct destructiveness (enhancing combat prowess is fine)

Exclusive: Only Rabbit/Cat can bring supernatural luck

Forbidden: Cannot conjure raw destruction (fireballs, explosions)

Dragon: Magnanimous, stately, vigorous, strong, self-assured, proud, noble, direct, dignified, zealous, eccentric, intellectual, fiery, passionate, decisive, pioneering, ambitious, artistic, generous, loyal. Can be tactless, arrogant, imperious, tyrannical, demanding, intolerant, dogmatic, violent, impetuous, brash. Base casting time of 2.

Good At: Majesty, elemental command, leadership, fire and storm

Bad At: Subtlety, concealment, humility

Forbidden: Cannot hide itself or act quietly

Snake: Deep thinker, wise, mystic, graceful, soft-spoken, sensual, creative, prudent, shrewd, ambitious, elegant, cautious, responsible, calm, strong, constant, purposeful. Can be loner, bad communicator, possessive, hedonistic, self-doubting, distrustful, mendacious, suffocating, cold. Base casting time of 1.

Good At: Wisdom, insight, charm, divination, poison, healing

Bad At: Open warfare, raw strength, brash directness

Forbidden: Cannot inspire or lead

Horse: Cheerful, popular, quick-witted, changeable, earthy, perceptive, talkative, agile - mentally and physically, magnetic, intelligent, astute, flexible, open-minded. Can be fickle, arrogant, childish, anxious, rude, gullible, stubborn. Base casting time of 3.

Good At: Speed, freedom, charisma, celebration, inspiration

Bad At: Stealth, patience, subtle plotting

Forbidden: Cannot cloak or conceal

Alicorn (Ram/Unicorn): Righteous, sincere, sympathetic, mild-mannered, shy, artistic, creative, gentle, compassionate, understanding, mothering, determined, peaceful, generous, seeks security. Can be moody, indecisive, over-passive, worrier, pessimistic, over-sensitive, complainer, weak-willed. Base casting time of 3.

Good At: Purity, compassion, healing, nurturing, artistry

Bad At: Deception, cruelty, destructive rage

Exclusive: Holy effects; damaging Alicorn effects do double damage against demons, aberrations, and undead

Forbidden: Cannot curse or corrupt

Monkey: Inventor, motivator, improviser, quick-witted, inquisitive, flexible, innovative, problem solver, self-assured, sociable, artistic, polite, dignified, competitive, objective, factual, intellectual. Can be egotistical, vain, selfish, reckless, snobbish, deceptive, manipulative, cunning, jealous, suspicious. Base casting time of 2, but can trade casting time for base cost, or vice versa, so long as neither go below 0.

Good At: Skill, improvisation, cunning, invention, agility

Bad At: Formal ritual, solemnity, patience

Forbidden: All Monkey effects are immediate; they cannot be delayed, and all enchantments must be constant.

Phoenix: Radiant, transformative, proud, passionate, sacrificial, regenerative, and impossible to keep down. Phoenix governs fire, purification, rebirth, renewal, self-sacrifice, and hope rising from catastrophe. Base casting time 3.

Good At: Rebirth, renewal, purification, sacrificial power, inspiration, fire

Bad At: Concealment, cold preservation, stagnation

Forbidden: Cannot create undead or preserve a living thing in an unchanging state

Wolf: Loyal, communal, watchful, relentless, territorial, intuitive, and bound by obligation. Wolf governs packs, oaths, hunting, cooperation, protection, and punishment for betrayal. Base casting time 3.

Good At: Loyalty, oaths, hunting, teamwork, protection, tracking

Bad At: Isolation, betrayal, indiscriminate chaos

Forbidden: Cannot compel betrayal of a willingly sworn oath

Boar: Honest, gallant, sturdy, sociable, peace-loving, patient, loyal, hard-working, trusting, sincere, calm, understanding, thoughtful, scrupulous, passionate, and tenacious. Boar can also be naïve, over-reliant, self-indulgent, gullible, fatalistic, or materialistic. Base casting time 2.

Good At: Courage, honesty, endurance, plenty, festivity, breaking barriers

Bad At: Subtle maneuvering, elegance, refinement

Forbidden: Cannot create delicate, intricate, or fine works

Crane: Base casting time 2.

Good At: Longevity, meditation, grace, travel between heights (sky/earth)

Bad At: Rage, destructiveness, chaos

Forbidden: No damaging effects
